{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>38歲「籃球女神」方泳琳與40歲前甲一球星陳張敏驚爆嚴重婚姻衝突，雙方將家事搬上社交平台引發激烈罵戰。男方率先以限時動態發文暗諷女方人設造假，女方隨即火力全開狂轟對方長期虛偽兼罔顧幼女健康。</p>\n<h2>上月尾ViuTV夫妻檔晒恩愛 轉頭即反面開火</h2>\n<p>方泳琳與陳張敏上月尾才以甜蜜夫妻姿態齊齊現身ViuTV綜藝節目《邊個瞓梳化？》參與錄影，女方當時更在網上發布合照展露燦爛笑容。事隔不足半個月，陳張敏於10月31日突然在社交平台發布一張抱住初生女兒舊照，並以黑底白字寫下「一個將自己人設set到女神咁既女人，癲起上嚟真係唔係一般人承受得起，我唔知究竟係咪揀錯路」。這番充滿火藥味言論瞬間辣㷫女方，令原本看似幸福美滿關係瞬間瓦解，雙方正式展開連日隔空罵戰。<br/>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179454280622272456_12054652546af68cd69a06d.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"62dd0bf4bb093d74dd582610404ccf25.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179454280622272456_12054652546af68cd69a06d.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>「籃球女神」方泳琳（Jessie）與丈夫陳張敏於 2023 年 12 月 27 日結婚，至今（2026 年 11 月）結婚接近 3 年（圖片來源：IG@lamlamjessie）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17945428087873857_9702570546af68cd93841f.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"SaveClip_App_871252722_18645725962044979_5661567742595865440_n.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17945428087873857_9702570546af68cd93841f.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>上月尾ViuTV夫妻檔晒恩愛（圖片來源：IG@lamlamjessie）</figcaption></figure>\n<h2>兩公婆隔空駁火火藥味濃 方泳琳怒轟虛偽「食煙湊女」</h2>\n<p>面對突如其來公開指責，方泳琳火速截圖反擊並狠批男方「承諾過嘅一樣都冇做到」，更直斥對方一直營造慈父形象全屬假象。她毫不留情踢爆陳張敏私下甚少陪伴年僅15個月大女兒，連上載網上所謂父女溫馨照亦只是翻箱倒櫃找出來舊相。當中觸發女方底線是男方長期有不良嗜好，方泳琳怒罵「仲話love個女forever，又係得個講字囉，食煙喎，帶啲3手煙俾個女叫love？」，同時堅定表明「我就一定知道自己係揀錯嫁喇！」。</p>\n<h2>方泳琳出動AI拆解陳張敏心理 直斥男方逃避責任</h2>\n<p>這場風波最令外界震驚一環，是方泳琳將男方發文直接交由人工智能進行深度心理評估，並公開詢問「一個咩人先會講呢段說話，佢講呢段嘢嘅動機係乜嘢？」。系統分析報告毫不客氣指出男方正處於「防禦心極強、試圖轉移焦點，且感到尊嚴受損」狀態，並帶有「自尊心極高且好面子」、「成熟度不足，習慣逃避責任」等特質。隨後女方轉戰Threads發布長文大吐苦水，控訴自己每日包辦家庭開支與接送幼女，經濟完全獨立卻不獲體諒，相反男方僅陪伴數分鐘便輕易獲得好爸爸稱讚。</p>\n<h2>貼文交AI深度心理分析 網民笑爆：公審界新高度</h2>\n<p>兩大球壇猛將互相揭發私隱極端手法引起全城熱烈討論，不少網民對於動用人工智能分析另一半性格做法感到不可思議。部分網民留言表示「用AI分析老公真係史無前例」、「公審界去到全新高度」，更有人諷刺男方「話人哋人設自己咪又係扮好爸爸」。期間亦有支持男方帶有吸煙惡習湊女言論出現，方泳琳即時公開標記對方帳號反擊「你有支持者 」。<br/>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179454281115682519_2557729146af68cdb7c4d9.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"SaveClip_App_762655254_18614658526044979_5774277876001575794_n.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179454281115682519_2557729146af68cdb7c4d9.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@lamlamjessie）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179454281386296855_6016091966af68cde84536.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"6319088269559272139.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179454281386296855_6016091966af68cde84536.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@lamlamjessie）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179454281553686347_18845503486af68ce024dff.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"6319088269559272138.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179454281553686347_18845503486af68ce024dff.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：threads）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179454281747180084_2765020556af68ce21ecfb.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"6319088269559272136.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179454281747180084_2765020556af68ce21ecfb.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：threads）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/01_14452681816846b0e0892a9-1024x1280.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"方泳琳 （圖片來源：IG@lamlamjessie）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/01_14452681816846b0e0892a9-1024x1280.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@lamlamjessie）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/11_8433116986846b0f4535e8-1024x1279.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"方泳琳 Jessie的老公陳張敏（Ryan）曾是南華球員，也是前男子組合4anda成員之一，現時效力於甲二球隊愉園，擔任隊長。（圖片來源：IG@lamlamjessie）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/11_8433116986846b0f4535e8-1024x1279.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>Jessie的老公陳張敏（Ryan）曾是南華球員，也是前男子組合4anda成員之一。（圖片來源：IG@lamlamjessie）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17945428205139816_16499846516af68ce5480cd.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"方泳琳 （圖片來源：IG@lamlamjessie）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17945428205139816_16499846516af68ce5480cd.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@lamlamjessie）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/10_17415872636846b0f22b980-1024x1280.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"方泳琳 二人結婚1年半，早前宣布懷孕喜訊。（圖片來源：IG@lamlamjessie）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/10_17415872636846b0f22b980-1024x1280.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>二人結婚1年半就宣布懷孕喜訊。（圖片來源：IG@lamlamjessie）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/03_16133528756846b0e4c72af-1024x1280.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"方泳琳 （圖片來源：FB@Lam Lam Jessie 方泳琳 ）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/03_16133528756846b0e4c72af-1024x1280.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：FB@Lam Lam Jessie 方泳琳 ）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/05_16360336396846b0e91aab1-1024x1280.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"方泳琳 （圖片來源：FB@Lam Lam Jessie 方泳琳 ）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/05_16360336396846b0e91aab1-1024x1280.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：FB@Lam Lam Jessie 方泳琳 ）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/08_4471861036846b0ee5035e-1024x1280.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"方泳琳 （圖片來源：FB@Lam Lam Jessie 方泳琳）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/08_4471861036846b0ee5035e-1024x1280.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：FB@Lam Lam Jessie 方泳琳）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179454282269554325_781338616af68ce703e63.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"itPhwcWlnX6CWoKMbA9oozPKSOxupI4MuO5IkLjuSJA.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179454282269554325_781338616af68ce703e63.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@lamlamjessie）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179454282473722848_9726178696af68ce93315b.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"lamlamjessie_1691675100_3164987157408843584_492978.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179454282473722848_9726178696af68ce93315b.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@lamlamjessie）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T04:15:25.535185+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1674,"images":15,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T04:07:11+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T05:30:02.185837+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T04:08:57.868012+00:00","content_hash":"0a377d721bc943307cb9d633fba8f65c3d718218d8df55dfbc755c6dbe8b6311","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}